@startuml uc-19
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Administrador" as Admin

package "Sistema de Facturación" {
  usecase "UC-19 Cancelar deuda incobrable" as UC19
  usecase "Indicar motivo de cancelación" as Motivo
  usecase "UC-16 Gestionar aprobaciones" as UC16
}

Admin --> UC19

UC19 ..> Motivo : <<include>>
UC19 ..> UC16 : <<include>>

note right of UC19
  Precondición: Existe una factura
  vencida y sin cobrar.
end note
@enduml